I've once set up a cross-compiler from i386-pc-linux-gnu to
i386-mingw32msvc.  IIRC, this was as easy as giving the correct
options to the binutils and gcc configure scripts as explained in
the INSTALL (or was it INSTALL.cross?) documents.

If you want to collect the resulting files in Debian binary
packages, then I suppose the toolchain-source package could
help; its description says it contains scripts for this purpose.
